{"text": "They searched everywhere, in the folds of her dress, in the folds of her coat, and in the pockets, but they found nothing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her husband went out again and walked over the whole route they had taken home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He went to the police and to the cab companies, and he even put an advertisement in the newspapers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the end of a week they had lost all hope, and Loisel, who looked five years older, said, We must replace the necklace. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In a shop at the Palais Royal, they found a string of diamonds that seemed exactly like the one they had lost. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It cost forty thousand francs, but they could have it for thirty six thousand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Loisel had eighteen thousand francs from his father, and he borrowed the rest from anyone who would lend it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He signed promises to pay, made ruinous agreements, and risked the rest of his life. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Madame Loisel took the necklace back, Madame Forestier said coldly, You should have returned it sooner. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She did not open the box, and Madame Loisel felt a great relief.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", "y", " ", "s", "e", "a", "r", "c", "h", "e", "d", " ", "e", "v", "e", "r", "y", "w", "h", "e", "r", "e", ",", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "l", "d", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "d", "r", "e", "s", "s", ",", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "l", "d", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "c", "o", "a", "t", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "o", "c", "k", "e", "t", "s", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "f", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", "r", " ", "h", "u", "s"